<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 52,752.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 52,752.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of October 10 totaled 52,752 bales, up slightly from 52,062 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 769 bales issued, no decertification orders, 79 cancellations, and 4,000 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
